OL,3,GNEWSANew EU-UK deal should reduce
OL,4,A'Irish Sea border' impact
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new deal between the UK and the EU on
OL,7,Ffood, plants and animals is likely to
OL,8,Fbe significant for Northern Ireland by
OL,9,Freducing the impact of the "Irish Sea
OL,10,Fborder".
OL,12,FThe agreement is expected to be
OL,13,Fconfirmed later when Prime Minister
OL,14,FAndy Burnham meets European Commission
OL,15,FPresident Ursula von der Leyen in
OL,16,FBrussels.
OL,18,FSince Brexit, Northern Ireland has
OL,19,Fcontinued to follow EU rules for
OL,20,Fagri-food products while the rest of
OL,21,Fthe UK has not.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
