OL,3,GNEWSANew EU-UK deal should reduce
OL,4,A'Irish Sea border' impact
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new deal will see the whole UK
OL,7,Frealigning with EU rules on those
OL,8,Fproducts, meaning goods being sent from
OL,9,FGreat Britain to Northern Ireland will
OL,10,Fno longer need to be checked at ports.
